  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 23 ÷ 18 + 150 × 50 - 44 = ?\n\nAccording to the question, after '×' and '÷' are interchanged and '-' and '+' are interchanged:\n\n23 ÷ 18 + 150 × 50 - 44 = ? ⇒ 23 × 18 - 150 ÷ 50 + 44 = ?\n\n⇒ 23 × 18 - __**150 **____**÷**____** 50**__ + 44 = ?\n\n⇒ __**23 ×**____** 18**__ - 3 + 44 = ?\n\n⇒ __**414**____** + 44**__ - 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __458 - 4__ = ?\n\n⇒ 455 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
